# The FM1 TONIC welcome screen (gfx.c welcome_draw, drawn at power-on): a screenshot to look at, and the screen is
# the whole 240 x 240 (a later job can check the pixels). The device shows it for about 1.2 s, then the version big for 500 ms (welcomever, wip215).
welcome
shot welcome.png
welcomever
shot welcome_version.png
